            "sid": "EXO 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaayeta Abaisiraeli boonaboona beesololeza gh'ali. Yaabakoba ati: “Bino n'ebintu Musengwa Katonda by'abalagiire okukola: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emirimo giidha kukolebwanga mu nnaku mukaaga, aye olunaku olwomusanvu, ni Sabbato, lunaku lwa Musengwa Katonda lwa kuwuumula era lutukuvu. Omuntu yeenayeena anaakolanga omulimo gwonagwona ku Sabbato aidha kwitibwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
